    <item>
      <title>on being successful</title>
      <link>/shower-thoughts/2025-06-05-on-being-successful/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 05 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/shower-thoughts/2025-06-05-on-being-successful/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;to understand what it means to be successful in life, it is important we first understand success itself.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;simply put: success is the accomplishment of a goal.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;therefore statistically speaking, to lead a successful life would mean to achieve &amp;gt;50% of our goals. in other words, accomplishing more goals than we fall short of during the course of our lives.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;so does success look the same for everyone? yes. like we stated earlier, it is the accomplishment of a goal.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>aren&#39;t we all &#34;on a diet&#34;?</title>
      <link>/shower-thoughts/2025-05-23-all-on-a-diet/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/shower-thoughts/2025-05-23-all-on-a-diet/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;some of us on one meal a day. some on low-carb. some on keto. the list goes on&amp;hellip; and some (read most) of us are on a eat-whatever-you-want diet. a go-with-the-flow diet.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;being intentional, deliberate and purposeful versus being unplanned and carefree.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;if we sat in a car and started driving with no destination in mind, the odds of us arriving at a nice place are very slim and we&amp;rsquo;re more likely to end up somewhere we don&amp;rsquo;t like.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
